      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color>  Text messages arrive on your phone \u2014
    press <b>E</b> to read them.\n<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color>  Emails are read
    on a <b>computer</b>: the downstairs desk or the upstairs computer room. Look
    at the monitor and press <b>E</b>.\n<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color>  Decide: <color=#F87171><b>SCAM</b></color>
    or <color=#22C55E><b>LEGITIMATE</b></color>.\n<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color> 
    Check the <b>sender</b>, whether it matches something <b>you did</b>, any <b>urgency</b>
    or pressure, and where <b>links</b> lead.\n<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color>  Faster
    correct answers earn more points (up to 100 per message). Wrong answers earn
    0.\n<color=#38BDF8>\u2022</color>  Stars reward your score (200 / 300 / 400).
    Reach <b>300</b> points to unlock the next room.\n"
